{"id":"en_second-chance-with-my-secret-lover","title":"Second Chance with My Secret Lover","titleEn":"Second Chance with My Secret Lover","description":"For five years, Emma Roberts remained Michael Frost's hidden partner, giving him her complete loyalty yet never earning a place in his heart. Everything fell apart when Michael became engaged and pushed her aside. At the same time, she received a devastating diagnosis: advanced heart failure, leaving her just three months to live.\n\nEmma wants nothing more than to slip away quietly and spend her remaining days in peace. That wish is quickly shattered. Michael's fiancée, a scheming suitor named Ashton Wills, a protective figure known as Mr. X, and her former boyfriend all re-enter her life one after another, pulling her into a perilous storm of romance, treachery, and buried secrets. Those interested in following this series can find it on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/second-chance-with-my-secret-lover/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/second-chance-with-my-secret-lover/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Romance","Urban","Toxic Relationship","Multiple Loves","Lover","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt6zm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_second-chance-with-my-secret-lover_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt6zm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_second-chance-with-my-secret-lover_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt6zm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_second-chance-with-my-secret-lover_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"s